        "escape :parameters (?human - human ?character - character ?location - location) :precondition (and (eaten ?human) (not (alive ?character)) (at ?character ?location)) :effect (and (not (eaten ?human)) (rescued ?human) (at ?human ?location)))": "(:action escape :parameters (?human - human ?character - character ?location - location) :precondition (and (eaten ?human) (not (alive ?character)) (at ?character ?location)) :effect (and (not (eaten ?human)) (rescued ?human) (at ?human ?location)))",
